 <section class="surface p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-model">ðŸ”„ Continuous learning</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold">Daily retraining & evaluation</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-haze">Scheduled daily at 04:00 WAT. Retained actual results feed chronological evaluations across supported sports and periods. A candidate updates unapproved forecasts only after beating its serving model on unseen results; no automatic betting approval.</p><dl class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><dt class="text-xs text-haze">Retained training examples</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">{learning?.rows??0}</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-haze">Latest completed run</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-sm">{learning?.lastRunAt?new Date(learning.lastRunAt).toLocaleString('en-NG',{timeZone:'Africa/Lagos'}):'Awaiting first run'}</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs text-haze">Status</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-words text-sm">{learningError||learning?.status||'Awaiting historical seed and collection'}</dd></div></dl>{#if learning?.report}<details class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-line p-3"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-semibold">Training evidence Â· {learning.report.segments?.length??0} segments</summary><p class="mt-3 text-xs text-haze">{learning.report.policy}</p><ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2">{#each learning.report.segments??[] as segment}<li class="rounded-lg bg-ink p-3 text-xs"><strong>{segment.sport} Â· {segment.league} Â· {segment.scope}</strong><p class="mt-1">{segment.rows} rows Â· {segment.status}</p>{#if segment.evaluation}<p class="mt-1 text-haze">Unseen fixtures: {segment.evaluation.n}. Brier candidate / serving: {segment.evaluation.candidateBrier?.toFixed(4)??'â€”'} / {segment.evaluation.incumbentBrier?.toFixed(4)??'â€”'}. New training results: {segment.evaluation.newTrainingRows}.</p>{#if segment.evaluation.pairedBrier}<p class="mt-2 text-haze">Paired evidence: {segment.evaluation.pairedBrier.nFixtures} fixtures · {segment.evaluation.pairedBrier.blocks} blocks. Brier change interval: {segment.evaluation.pairedBrier.interval95?.map((v:number)=>v.toFixed(4)).join(' to ')??'More independent fixture blocks needed'}. Negative favours the candidate; this is approximate historical evidence.</p>{/if}{#if segment.evaluation.markets}<details class="mt-2"><summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer py-3 font-semibold">Market family results</summary><div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">{#each Object.entries(segment.evaluation.markets) as [family,metrics]}{@const metric=metrics as any}<div class="rounded-lg border border-line p-3"><strong>{family==='home'?'Home team total':family==='away'?'Away team total':family==='margin'?'Handicap / spread':'Match total'}</strong><p class="mt-1">{metric.nOptions} option evaluations across the same fixtures</p><p class="mt-1 text-haze">Brier candidate / serving: {metric.candidateBrier.toFixed(4)} / {metric.incumbentBrier.toFixed(4)}</p><p class="mt-1 text-haze">Log loss: {metric.candidateLogLoss.toFixed(4)} / {metric.incumbentLogLoss.toFixed(4)}</p></div>{/each}</div></details>{/if}{/if}</li>{/each}</ul></details>{/if}</section>
 <TennisShadowPanel/>
